WEBVTT

00:28.425 --> 00:30.826
I was lost inside a silent scream

00:35.397 --> 00:38.919
Living out a fractured dream

00:41.501 --> 00:47.405
A ship without a sail, a drifted sea Thought the

00:47.485 --> 00:52.048
darkness was a part of me I never knew the sun

00:52.088 --> 00:57.291
could even shine Until your hand reached out for

00:57.351 --> 00:57.831
mine

01:01.602 --> 01:05.464
